    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hallowed Crucible you're a crusader who found a gun (and a little more). Undeath plagues your world. The zombies are heretics. Do what must be done in this single player zombie slaying arcade shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With faith, might and a little bit of luck. How long will you survive? and will you complete your crusade against the damned?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avenging the fallen against the horde</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342330/extras/88de447857ee99373bd597f798e107f9.poster.avif?t=1732573980\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342330/extras/88de447857ee99373bd597f798e107f9.webm?t=1732573980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342330/extras/88de447857ee99373bd597f798e107f9.mp4?t=1732573980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slaying abominations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342330/extras/fa183bdf584f4cf4ab9bc1a2a476583c.poster.avif?t=1732573980\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342330/extras/fa183bdf584f4cf4ab9bc1a2a476583c.webm?t=1732573980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342330/extras/fa183bdf584f4cf4ab9bc1a2a476583c.mp4?t=1732573980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video